    "The R6 entry/preflight/publication design is preserved with exact R2d source105/plan/runtime/source-review pins and three new sessions/roots. Each command matches its structured proposal byte for byte, has one srun, ARM64 short3h, one node/task, four CPUs,16GiB, zero GPUs and an empty installation list. The native root remains absent before the allocated authorization wait.",
