    "lane_support loads the exact reviewed SO reader d00b7856 and its review5ea7c7bc. It rechecks the immutable prior/cold inventory and all14 original identities/descendants against the exact fresh CURRENT census. A current report's verified flag alone is insufficient. SO received_absent contributes zero, preserved=false; observer release is bound to the same current census.",
    "Private observations/census/remote freshness/transport are checked at120 seconds, allocated markers at600 seconds. Source lane-v2 requires typed count0..3 before a new worker, cap4, exact cell/source/plan/job/root/time and nine digest references. The full Windows census, foreign configuration and credentials are not projected to ARM.",
    "New local and POSIX authorizations invoke the real source105 validator with its default initial fresh lane check. initial_lane=False occurs only while checking another declared existing R2d cohort cell after its exact authorization and a currently present complete launcher/Python pair are bound to that model/session/job/channel; it does not emit a new worker authorization or replace the new-start check.",
    "All three distinct jobs, single-submit intents, exact reviewed commands, original scheduler responses and zero-call allocation markers are required before authorization. Luna remains the received historical gate and is not replayed; no previous R2c session/cache is reused.",
    "Fourteen admission references are retained. Both Windows/POSIX validations rehash dependencies, exact four CLI files and f6dbf48c executable, source/plan, received Q/archive/audit, Luna bounded closure, reservation and nested lane projection. Only references and their SHA may be reencoded; the projected lane facts and projection bytes must match across environments.",
    "The stage contains23 dependencies plus authorization, with ready excluded. Readback must contain exactly these24 files plus the original allocation marker. Changed bytes, extra entries, duplicate models/jobs or mismatched ready identity refuse publication arguments. All three complete readbacks are checked before emitting any ready-upload arguments. These helpers execute no transfer or worker.",
    "The scientific receiver is explicitly an unadmitted interface skeleton, not a silently repinned R2c reader or result. It retains first-call/RAW/confirmation/cost/cache/audit requirements and explicitly forbids promotion of WARN/error/unknown events to NORMAL."
